          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On September 23, 1977, around midnight, a person walking their dog saw in the sky for one minute two circular-shaped objects. The underside was bright white and the top side darker. The objects moved in a northeasterly-southwestern direction without making any noise. They would initiate a turn before accelerating to a high altitude and disappearing. No unexpected echoes were recorded during the night at the control tower of the Istres Air Base. No other testimonies were collected.",
